      factLabels: ['Closest shop', 'Our bakery', 'Large arrival shop', 'Medical route'], facts: ['Silvia, a few steps away', 'Panadería Manolo', 'Lidl in upper Nerja', 'Nerja, then Vélez-Málaga'],
      shop: { title: 'Eating out is part of the holiday. So is choosing not to.', intro: ['Our food guides share where we like to eat. At AMARA you can also breakfast on the terrace, pack for the beach or make an easy dinner.'], localTitle: 'Small shops cover normal holiday needs', local: ['Frigiliana has several food shops and EROSKI/city in the **newer part of the village**. Nerja adds Lidl, Aldi and Mercadona for a larger shop.', 'In high season supermarkets also open on Sundays; outside high season and on holidays, check current hours.'], amaraTitle: 'For small things we walk; for the big shop we stop in Nerja', amara: ['We start with **Supermarket Silvia**: step outside, turn right and it is a few steps away. For bread we like **Panadería Manolo**, about four minutes along Calle Real with no stairs.', 'If you arrive late, shop at Lidl high in Nerja near the motorway before driving up. It is almost on your route and saves a second trip.'] },
      health: { title: 'A simple route when you need help', intro: ['Most small holiday problems start with a pharmacy.'], localTitle: 'One village pharmacy, healthcare in Nerja', local: ['Frigiliana has **one pharmacy**. For non-emergency public care, use **Centro de Salud Nerja**, Calle Carlos Millón s/n. Before setting out, check current service hours with SAS, Salud Responde (**+34 955 54 50 60**) or the centre (**+34 951 28 96 62**).', 'For urgent medical help without immediate danger to life, call **+34 951 03 14 37**. In a life-threatening medical emergency call **061**; **112** is the general emergency number. The nearest hospital is Hospital de La Axarquía in Vélez-Málaga.'], amaraTitle: 'The pharmacy is walkable; Nerja is a short drive', amara: ['The village pharmacy is reached along Calle Real toward the newer area. Centro de Salud Nerja is normally 10–15 minutes away by car.'] },
